    "It will be removed from %lld files, everywhere Spotlight has indexed. The files themselves aren’t deleted." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the delete-tag confirmation; %lld is how many files carry the tag.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
